############################################################
# WEB PARITY (DrivingTips.tsx is THE spec)
############################################################

Data sources    : useTranslation only (web leaf is prop-fed motorStats + throttleStyle).
                  Native: bound via DrivingTipsSource (P1/S8); no HTTP in the view.
Shared comps    : @/components/ui  -> TSGlassPanel (UI/Cards), TSButton (UI/Buttons),
                                      TSTone (UI/Badges), TSSkeleton (Feedback/Skeletons)
                  @/components/motion -> TSFadeIn (Motion/Motion), delay 0.6 preserved
Charts / maps   : none (web source uses neither) — Swift Charts / MapKit not required.
i18n keys       : all 9 web t() calls reproduced verbatim in DrivingTips.strings
                  (dynamics.recommendations, dynamics.tipNoData, .tipEaseAccel,
                   .tipBrakeEarly, .tipSmoothThrottle, .tipCoast, .tipGreat, .tipKeep,
                   .tipThermal) + 9 native-chrome keys (drivingTips.*). No English
                  literals in Swift (facade-resolved via DrivingTipsStrings).
Recommendation logic (exact port of the web useMemo, raw > thresholds):
    motorStats == null            -> ["Drive your vehicle…"]                 (empty body)
    avgPower  > 80                -> ease accelerator + brake earlier
    avgPower  > 20  (<= 80)       -> smooth throttle + coast
    avgPower <= 20                -> great + keep monitoring
    maxMotorTemp > 120           -> append thermal tip
    row icon = throttleStyle == 'conservative' ? ShieldCheck(green) : AlertTriangle(yellow)
                                  -> checkmark.shield.fill / exclamationmark.triangle.fill
States rendered (every one, no hidden surface):
    loading  -> card-shaped skeleton rows (never a blank box)
    empty    -> panel keeps the single "Drive your vehicle…" recommendation (web branch)
    error    -> QueryError peer: title + message + Retry (TSButton)
    data     -> recommendation list, TSFadeIn delay 0.6
    stale    -> header freshness chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh (P4 leaf contract)
    offline  -> header chip + banner, cached recommendations retained, no refetch
Accessibility   : header isHeader trait; each row .ignore + verbatim tip label; list
                  .contain with a joined VoiceOver summary; freshness chip + refresh +
                  retry labelled; icons accessibilityHidden. Dynamic Type via Font.TS
                  tokens; Reduce Motion honoured by TSFadeIn / TSSkeleton.
Telemetry       : DrivingTips.start() emits view.opened surface="DrivingTips" (P1/S11),
                  asserted once-only by DrivingTipsModelTests.

